bsh-shell (5.14.4-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Rebuild against brightdate-rust v0.5.3.  The v0.5.2 git tag did not
    include the btime color commits; v0.5.3 is the first tag with
    `--color` / `--no-color` / `--color-scheme` support in the btime
    builtin and binary.
  * Note: the shell `time` keyword (TIMEFMT milliday output) is separate
    from the `btime` builtin; use `btime cmd` for colored BrightDate
    timing reports.

 -- Jessica Mulein <jessica@digitaldefiance.org>  Fri, 29 May 2026 18:00:00 +0000

